    "question": "A planet revolves around the Sun in an elliptical orbit. Its closest distance from the Sun (perihelion) is $r_1 = 2 \\times 10^{10}\\text{ m}$ and its farthest distance (aphelion) is $r_2 = 6 \\times 10^{10}\\text{ m}$. If its speed at perihelion is $v_1 = 40\\text{ km/s}$, its speed at aphelion is:",
