    "questionNumber": 451,
    "question": "A body is projected from the surface of the Earth with a speed equal to $3$ times the escape velocity ($v = 3 v_e$). What will be its residual speed in interstellar space (at infinity)?",
    "options": {
      "A": "2.83 v_e",
      "B": "3 v_e",
      "C": "2 v_e",
      "D": "1.42 v_e"
    },
